      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC, there are really two logically separate changes here:\n\n- Always include the dirtree hash (if available) in the filenames.\n- Switch the strong hash algorithm from \"use the second-to-last ciphertext block\" to SHA-256, and optimize performance by only using it for very long filenames.\n\nCan you make the commit message reflect the reasoning behind both of these changes?",
